        "created_at": "2016-02-23T13:01:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MrLeRobot\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/48/1932_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MrLeRobot:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I also remember vaguely a statement from Christopher in one of the recent Q&amp;A. This is something along the lines of:Q: What does Dawn think of Ambucade?A: Dawn thinks Ambuscade is a waste, in many ways…or something like that. Doesn't this puts weight on Ambuscade being Expat's father/the same guy on Quick Draw?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I mean, except for the fact that Ambuscade was never a Citizen of the Sun with natural powers&nbsp;and that he isn't&nbsp;currently dead, sure.</p>",
