        "created_at": "2016-02-26T07:05:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Guys guys guys... It's guise.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Guise is her dad.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because he's just that awesome.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>More seriously, another thing worth pointing out is that Newest Legacy has just turned 18 and is PP8's eldest (likely only, but for the sake of entertaining that she has siblings, she has to be eldest because it goes to the eldest), so Expat would have to be younger than her. This can't be because Dawn spent decades running from the world before setting up shop on Insula Primalis and then forming the citizens of the sun. So yeah, no way she bore Legacy 2 kids in that time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Plus, word of god and all.</p>",
